    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deadHex is a head-to-head tactical FPS meets MOBA, where every shot counts and every build tells a story. Battle to destroy your opponent\u2019s HQ in a game of precision, strategy, and brutal efficiency.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the world of the Hamlet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across different maps and themes as you cement your legacy as a Hexor. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play the way you want to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match is a 1v1 duel where you'll draft your build from hundreds of combinations\u2014balancing movement, firepower, durability, and Hex power. Whether you're a sharpshooter or a juggernaut, you decide how you win.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wield powerful artifacts to shake up the battlefield.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merchants from far and wide come to provide their wares.  Harness the power of ancient artifacts that grant special abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hire mercenaries to wreak havoc on your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send in mercenaries\u2014elite units or overwhelming swarms\u2014to push the map and pressure enemy defenses. Timing and gold investment matter: a smart mercenary play can end the game before the next firefight even starts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deadHex is a head-to-head tactical FPS meets MOBA, where every shot counts and every build tells a story. Battle to destroy your opponent\u2019s HQ in a game of precision, strategy, and brutal efficiency.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the world of the Hamlet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across different maps and themes as you cement your legacy as a Hexor. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play the way you want to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match is a 1v1 duel where you'll draft your build from hundreds of combinations\u2014balancing movement, firepower, durability, and Hex power. Whether you're a sharpshooter or a juggernaut, you decide how you win.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wield powerful artifacts to shake up the battlefield.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merchants from far and wide come to provide their wares.  Harness the power of ancient artifacts that grant special abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hire mercenaries to wreak havoc on your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send in mercenaries\u2014elite units or overwhelming swarms\u2014to push the map and pressure enemy defenses. Timing and gold investment matter: a smart mercenary play can end the game before the next firefight even starts.</p>",
